{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2D platformer game where you can use the power of nature to perform various actions.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrowing the power of different vegetation on each stage, you'll be able to use different actions to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the five stages features its own unique vegetation \u2014<br>morning glories, roses, rubber trees, and many more \u2014<br>all beautifully depicted in pixel art.You can borrow their powers to aid you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of water and nature that &quot;Suiren&quot; can use to overcome the fear of fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/extras/21b723ef1d9e5bd2905810c2c127febb.poster.avif?t=1770433285\" width=558 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/extras/21b723ef1d9e5bd2905810c2c127febb.webm?t=1770433285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/extras/21b723ef1d9e5bd2905810c2c127febb.mp4?t=1770433285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/extras/1ff57168f6cb92248f4383b57d4b4b96.avif?t=1770433285\" width=882 height=932 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suiren</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'll protect everything, just watch me, Mom.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and kind-hearted girl from the land of grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her innate power over water and her ability to commune with nature,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she sets out to uncover the cause of the great wildfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/extras/d1a352fffb03e123715370a79e55b04c.avif?t=1770433285\" width=1560 height=862 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lena</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhy only you...?! I won\u2019t forgive you!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl from the Land of Fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the day the forest fire broke out,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she has appeared before Suilen time and again\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as if driven by a greater purpose hidden deep within her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and More...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her fifteenth birthday, <strong>Suilen</strong> is appointed as the new chief of her village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhy do villages around here always make someone my age the chief!?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWell, let\u2019s just do our best \u2014 no need to stress about it!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her childhood friend <strong>Nana</strong> comes to celebrate, bringing laughter and warmth to the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the peaceful moment doesn\u2019t last long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark smoke rises in the distance, from the direction of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHuh...? Smoke...? Is that... a fire!?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can understanding truly bridge the divide between differences?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014The story of <i>a single drop that can change the world</i> begins now.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamsta