o/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/extras/1ff57168f6cb92248f4383b57d4b4b96.avif?t=1770433285\" width=882 height=932 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suiren</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'll protect everything, just watch me, Mom.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and kind-hearted girl from the land of grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her innate power over water and her ability to commune with nature,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she sets out to uncover the cause of the great wildfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/extras/d1a352fffb03e123715370a79e55b04c.avif?t=1770433285\" width=1560 height=862 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lena</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhy only you...?! I won\u2019t forgive you!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl from the Land of Fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the day the forest fire broke out,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she has appeared before Suilen time and again\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as if driven by a greater purpose hidden deep within her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and More...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her fifteenth birthday, <strong>Suilen</strong> is appointed as the new chief of her village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhy do villages around here always make someone my age the chief!?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWell, let\u2019s just do our best \u2014 no need to stress about it!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her childhood friend <strong>Nana</strong> comes to celebrate, bringing laughter and warmth to the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the peaceful moment doesn\u2019t last long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark smoke rises in the distance, from the direction of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHuh...? Smoke...? Is that... a fire!?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can understanding truly bridge the divide between differences?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014The story of <i>a single drop that can change the world</i> begins now.</p>","developers":["\u3088\u3073\u3060\u3057Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091620/54f3002c920a3d4529429e696b54803313255a36/header.jpg?t=1770433285","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4091620/1592091598/638ca69f7f9298984686a9cf70f70d9a88925a53/1762101317/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762102270","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4091620/1592091598/638ca69f7f9298984686a9cf70f70d9a88925a53/1762101317/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762102270","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4091620/1592091598/638ca69f7f9298984686a9cf70f70d9a88925a53/1762101317/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762102270","id":257225811,"name":"Promotion1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225811/86860c1d152d0eb07085a62db915a8963281c4e0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762102270"}],"name":"Suiren","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stron